  "html": "<p><b>Quest Giver:</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Soldier_Germ\" title=\"Soldier Germ\">Soldier Germ</a></p>\n<p><b>Quest Type:</b> Hunt</p>\n<p><b>Quest Description:</b> Kill 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulks\" title=\"Mutant Hulks\">Mutant Hulks</a> and 20 <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Pukers\" title=\"Mutant Pukers\">Mutant Pukers</a> and return to <a href=\"/wiki/Soldier_Germ\" title=\"Soldier Germ\">Soldier Germ</a> on Level 5 of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>.</p>\n<p><b>Quest Reward:</b> 2500 Gold and 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Kings_Coin\" title=\"Kings Coin\">Kings Coin</a></p>\n<p><b>Return to:</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Soldier_Germ\" title=\"Soldier Germ\">Soldier Germ</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a></p>\n<p><b>Repeatable:</b> No</p>\n\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
